<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">“My computer is slow” might mean waiting to sign in, waiting for a program to open, or waiting for a website. Before paying for a replacement computer or a faster internet plan, describe the delay more precisely.</p>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">The aim is to choose a sensible next investigation. You do not need to diagnose the fault yourself.</p>
<h2 class="mt-12 mb-5 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl">Start with one ordinary task</h2>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Pick something you normally do and describe where the waiting begins. Avoid changing settings for this first comparison.</p>
